{"id":"607925","name":"红油猪肝粉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/607925/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"120g"},{"name":"猪肝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"1小根"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肝洗净切片。","img":"images/607925/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清水反复清洗至水清为止。","img":"images/607925/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/607925/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开即可。","img":"images/607925/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洗净浮沫备用。","img":"images/607925/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/607925/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放切好的葱姜及泡椒。","img":"images/607925/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放生抽炒均匀。","img":"images/607925/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放清水和丝瓜片。","img":"images/607925/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/607925/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/607925/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放白糖。","img":"images/607925/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/607925/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放猪肝。","img":"images/607925/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/607925/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"取油辣子。","img":"images/607925/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"倒入油辣子。","img":"images/607925/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"做菜的同时煮米粉。","img":"images/607925/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"开锅洗净，放冷水再煮。","img":"images/607925/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"再次开锅。","img":"images/607925/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"再放冷水洗完再冷水煮。","img":"images/607925/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"大约重复3次米粉就煮好了。","img":"images/607925/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"切葱末放碗底。","img":"images/607925/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"捞起米粉装盘。","img":"images/607925/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"倒入做好的红油猪肝汤即可。","img":"images/607925/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}